 FIM:{family:'baseline_file_change_monitoring_vocabulary',meaning:'Qualify comparing files with trusted reference baselines and alerting on change; change still requires authorization and impact review.',limits:['A legitimate update can differ from a baseline; an alert is not proof of malicious modification.','No complete visibility, trusted-baseline establishment, blocking, rollback or actual incident detection is demonstrated.']},
