 OWASP:{defer:true,family:'historical_foundation_name_authority_held',meaning:'The expansion retains the former Open Web name without historical qualification; the foundation adopted Worldwide in 2023. Community authority wording also needs boundaries around the foundation and its resources.',limits:['Hold until historical naming and informational-resource status are clear; a Top10 reference is not legal authority, certification or a complete security standard.','No edition, ranking, compliance, full application-security coverage or individual attack skill is approved.']},
