 SWG:{family:'outbound_web_gateway_policy_vocabulary',meaning:'Qualify web gateway/proxy policy filtering as a capability dependent on deployment and traffic visibility.',limits:['This browsing role differs from inbound application filtering, with possible product overlap; do not infer a VPN, endpoint antivirus or complete safe-browsing guarantee.','No encrypted-traffic inspection, route enforcement, policy correctness or real blocked request is demonstrated.']},
 TAXII:{family:'CTI_exchange_protocol_vocabulary',meaning:'The glossary uses the Intelligence Information expansion, unlike the held card. Qualify protocol-role vocabulary only; the differing glossary cannot repair that card.',limits:['TAXII2.1 exchanges CTI over HTTPS and can carry supported non-STIX formats; versions, negotiation, access and trust remain separate.','Preserve the prior combined STIX/TAXII question-family holds and zero-credit TAXII card; no interoperability, independent component skill or real exchange is proven.']},
